ement\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nEmergency Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOphthalmology\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nPrevious Slide\nNext Slide\nExpertise for Middle-of-the-Night Emergencies and Advanced Specialty Care\nYou can trust the highly trained team at MedVet Dallas to serve as an extension of your family veterinarian’s care. Our hospital offers the most comprehensive, state-of-the-art emergency and specialty veterinary care in the area.\nServing more than 25,000 patients a year, our team is the trusted choice for family veterinarians and pet lovers. We know pets are an important part of your family, and we strive to provide exceptional care while showing compassion for you and your pet. Our team has the expertise to diagnose and treat your pet, giving the best chance for a positive outcome.\nWe know pets are family! While our healthcare teams provide medical care for each pet who walks through our hospital doors, our\nVeterinary Social Work\nteam supports the people and families who love them.\nIf your pet is facing an emergency, you can come directly to our hospital – no appointment is needed. Our expert team is available for pet emergencies 24 hours a day, 365 days a year.\nMedVet Dallas Caregivers\nSearch by Name\nFilter by Specialty\nAll Specialties\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nEmergency Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOphthalmology\nSocial Work\nSurgery\nOur Hospital Leaders\nCarrie Davis, DVM, DACVAA\nMedical Director\nKim Ward, LVT\nHospital Director\nOur Doctors\nBetzaida (Betzy) Acevedo Hernández\n, DVM, DACVS (Small Animal)\nSurgery\nRachel Anderson\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nChristine Ashman\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nDominique Capaldo\n, DVM\nInternal Medicine\nTrey J. Celentano\n, DVM\nJennifer Cline\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nCarrie Davis\n, DVM, DACVAA\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nElizabeth De la Torre\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nRaeAnn Didier\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nHéctor Encarnación\n, DVM, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nHazel R. Faz\n, DVM\nKara Fenity\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nThomas Graves\n, DVM, MS, PhD, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nEmily Hartman\n, DVM, MS, DACVS (Small Animal)\nSurgery\nSarah Heinemann\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nHaley Hensel\n, DVM\nGabriella Herrejon\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nNicole Jaramillo Meza\n, DVM\nAngela Joergensen\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nDanielle Johnson\n, MSW, LMSW\nSocial Work\nShannon Keane\n, DVM, Residency Trained in Veterinary Emergency & Critical Care\nCritical Care\nMeriel LeSueur\n, DVM, DACVIM (Cardiology)\nCardiology\nCristina Mastromonaco\n, DVM, MS\nEmergency Medicine\nBobbi McQuown\n, DVM, DACVIM (Oncology)\nMedical Oncology\nCaeley Melmed\n, DVM, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nArielle Ostrager\n, VMD, DACVIM (Neurology)\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nCourtney O’Connor\n, DVM, DACVECC\nCritical Care\nErika Haschke Pickens\n, DVM, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nJesse Prinsloo\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nErin Rogers\n, DVM, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nLucy Ryder\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nMaddie Scaffidi\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nVictoria L. Smetana\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nAbigail Sturbaum\n, DVM, DACVO®\nOphthalmology\nSamantha Tierney\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nDani M. Williams\n, DVM, DACVECC\nCritical Care\nPatricia Williams\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nShow All Doctors (\n37\n)\nPet Stories\n“\nThey saved my dog’s leg. My 10-month-old toy Australian Shepherd broke her pencil-thin leg jumping off a bed. MedVet scheduled surgery the next day with a Board-certified surgeon. The surgery went great and my puppy acts like nothing happened. The caring staff, top-notch doctors, and thorough treatment are exceptional. So grateful.”\nPrevious Story\nNext Story\nFinancing Options\nWe understand that planning for the cost of care is important. Special financing and payment arrangements are available for qualified pet owners through an independent company, CareCredit.\nLearn More\nFind a location\nEmergency Care\nFind Care\nFind a Location\nFind A Doctor\nResources\nPet Care Resources\nClinical Studies\nAbout\nWe Are MedVet\nMedVet Experience\nOur Leaders\nOur Founders\nNewsroom\nDiversity, Inclusion, & Belonging\nCommunity Support\nFAQs\nContact Us\nFor Veterinarians\nClinical Studies\nContinuing Education\nCareers\nMedVet Open Positions at New Hospitals\nMedVet Training Programs\nSpecialties\nSpecialties Overview\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nAvian & Exotics\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nDentistry & Oral Surgery\nDermatology\nEmergency Medicine\nIntegrative Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nInterventional Radiology\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOphthalmology\nRadiation Oncology\nRadiology\nRehabilitation\nSports Medicine\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nSocial\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nFacebook\nYouTube\nPartners\nVetRad\nVeterinary Eye Institute\nMedVet Suppliers\nLegal\nPrivacy Policy\nCA Privacy\nYour Privacy Choices\nTerms\nTransparency in Coverage\nTax Information",
